<title>GERMANY: ABB names new German director.</title>
<headline>ABB names new German director.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asea Brown Boveri AG said on Wednesday it had named Joachim Schneider to its management board, with responsibility for electricity distribution, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Schneider succeeds Sune Karlsson, who will take up s similar post for the parent company in Zurich.</p>
<p>Schneider has been on the board of ABB Calor Emag Schaltanlagen AG since 1994.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
